    # ALCOTT @ talk "What you were is irrelevant to what you {i}are{/i} now."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Кем ты был не имеет значения по сравнению с тем, кем ты {i}являешься{/i} сейчас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2181
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_c9a63b4d:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "They have all been detained for the time being."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Все они пока-что временно задержаны."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2182
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_05ecc8fa:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "But your companions are alive."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Но твои спутники живы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2186
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_cb82d705:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "The battle raged on, of course. The city suffered heavy losses..."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Битва конечно продолжалась. Город понёс тяжёлые потери..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2187
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_be06700b:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "But with the internal threat dealt with, we were able to refocus on repelling the Demorai."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Но с устранением внутренней угрозы мы смогли сосредоточиться на отражении Деморай."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2188
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_e6e9eae5:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "It seems that without you and your companions... this city would have fallen."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Похоже, что без тебя и твоих спутников... этот город пал бы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2189
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_17cf0b94:

    # MC @ talk "And my thanks is to be bound in chains..."
    MC @ talk "А моя благодарность заключается в оковах..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2190
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_c7418592:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "For now, yes."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Пока что, да."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2196
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_bd3be56d:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "I want answers."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Я хочу ответов."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2197
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_185f7f09:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "And if you speak the truth, I {i}might{/i} spare your life."
    ALCOTT @ talk "И если ты скажешь правду, я {i}возможно{/i} пощажу твою жизнь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2198
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_f90a1334:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "What are you?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "Что ты такое?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2199
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_ccc5fb1f:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Even Alderay's finest scholars and mages remain clueless as to your nature."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Даже лучшие учёные и маги Алдерея остаются в неведении относительно твоей природы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2200
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_70c726e6:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "So tell me, creature."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Так скажи мне, существо."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2201
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_e2e4dace:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Are you more man... or beast?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "Ты больше человек... или зверь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2204
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_89549a6e:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Hmm... Interesting."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Хм... Интересно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2206
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_dcaf0f9e:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Is that so?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "Неужели?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2208
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_59a9666f:

    # ALCOTT @ joy "Ha! Coin, is it?"
    ALCOTT @ joy "Ха! Монета, значит?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2209
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_c952c787:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Well, you wouldn't be the first whose allegiance is for sale."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Что ж, ты не первый, чья преданность продаётся."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2210
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_2e83dd0c:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "You served under Captain Duprey in the scouts, did you not?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "Ты служил под началом Капитана Дюпре в разведке, не так ли?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2211
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_ec863f7f:

    # MC @ talk "Yes."
    MC @ talk "Да."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2212
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_cd7b9399:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "And you didn't even finish basic training before you and your division were sent to investigate a fort just beyond the Valley of Death, correct?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "И ты даже не успел закончить базовую подготовку, прежде чем тебя и твой отряд отправили исследовать форт за Долиной Смерти, верно?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2213
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_690fff87:

    # MC @ talk "...Yes."
    MC @ talk "...Да."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2214
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_2e4a0e45:

    # "Alcott exhaled sharply, shaking his head with a smirk."
    "Алкотт резко выдохнул, покачивая головой с усмешкой."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2215
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_5e4c3121:

    # ALCOTT @ smile "{i}It seems the old man still has a few tricks up his sleeve.{/i}"
    ALCOTT @ smile "{i}Похоже, у старика ещё остались козыри в рукаве.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2216
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_bde6c2b6:

    # MC @ think "What?"
    MC @ think "Что?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2217
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_31a4284b:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "You and your division were never supposed to head that way."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Ты и твоё подразделение никогда не должны были идти туда."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2218
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_38aa86ea:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Your orders were to patrol the valley briefly before heading west to Inma for six months."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Ваш приказ был недолго патрулировать долину, а затем отправиться на запад в Инму на шесть месяцев."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2219
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_dcc2b33d:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Instead, you were pushed deep into Demorai territory."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Вместо этого вас загнали глубоко на территорию Деморай."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2220
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_alcott_menu_bde6c2b6_1:

    # MC @ think "What?"
    MC @ think "Что?"

