    KIARA @ talk "Это таверна неподалёку, у нас уже подготовлена комната."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3580
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_3dc1a544:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Gods... Look at this place!"
    MARKUS @ shock "Боги... Взгляни на это место!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3581
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_b702726f:

    # MARKUS @ shock "I had heard rumors about how much the city had changed since it broke away, but-"
    MARKUS @ shock "Я слышал слухи о том, как сильно изменился город после отделения, но—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3582
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_095355cd:

    # MARKUS @ joy "It's certainly an impressive sight."
    MARKUS @ joy "Это действительно впечатляющее зрелище."

