translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6a80da6d:

    # MC @ think "Who are you looking for?"
    MC @ think "Кого ты ищешь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3600
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_1b256352:

    # "Ves opened her mouth to say something, but she paused and smiled awkwardly, changing the subject quickly."
    "Вес открыла рот чтобы что-то сказать, но замялась и неловко улыбнулась, быстро сменив тему."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3601
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_2c8bbd11:

    # VES @ smile "I'll... tell you about it another time."
    VES @ smile "Я... расскажу тебе об этом в другой раз."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3602
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_f97d9bbc:

    # VES @ talk "Come, I'm tired... Let's find this {i}Pale Dragon.{/i}"
    VES @ talk "Пойдем, я устала... Давай найдем этого {i}Бледного Дракона.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3616
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_bad11f44:

    # "Smoke rose from every corner of the inn, a mixture of strange, hot aromas like that of sweet, crushed flowers all mixed in."
    "Дым поднимался из каждого угла таверны, смесь странных, горячих ароматов, словно от сладких, раздавленных цветов, всё перемешалось."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3617
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8ac356c7:

    # "With every breath, you could feel a small surge of energy as the whole place seemed embraced by a hazy fog."
    "С каждым вдохом чувствовался небольшой прилив энергии, будто всё это место окутано туманной дымкой."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3618
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_a9959744:

    # "Sat hudled around tables, men, women, {i}other things,{/i} sat smoking from their pipes as the raza choked the air."
    "За столами, сгорбившись, сидели мужчины, женщины, {i}иные существа,{/i} курившие из своих трубок, пока раза наполняла воздух."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3619
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_007901a8:

    # "In and around the place were guards, always watching, already ready for trouble, as the loosely dressed women served drinks."
    "Внутри и вокруг помещения стояли стражи, всегда настороже, готовые к неприятностям, пока легко одетые женщины разносили напитки."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3623
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_4e4e3c61:

    # RANIA @ talk "Welcome... Welcome to {i}The Pale dragon,{/i} I am your host, Rania."
    RANIA @ talk "Добро пожаловать... Добро пожаловать в {i}Бледном Драконе,{/i} я ваша хозяйка, Рания."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3625
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_456841ec:

    # RANIA @ talk "What pleasures do you and your companions seek?"
    RANIA @ talk "Каких удовольствий вы и ваши спутники ищете?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3626
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_72b4870f:

    # RANIA @ smile "Perhaps some Raza or... {i}companionship?{/i}"
    RANIA @ smile "Может, немного Разы или... {i}компании?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3627
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_e06794ab:

    # "The woman looked towards me and Markus, pulling down her dress slightly to expose a breast as she winked."
    "Женщина посмотрела на меня и Маркуса, слегка спустив платье дабы обнажить грудь и подмигнула."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3628
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_b4652a2d:

    # MC @ lewd "Well-"
    MC @ lewd "Что ж-"

