translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_18a797f5:

    # RANIA @ smile "Everything is already ready for you, first room on the left upstairs."
    RANIA @ smile "Всё уже готово для вас, первая комната слева наверху."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3634
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_9856acc2:

    # "Rania's eyes glanced over towards those with me."
    "Взгляд Рании скользнул по тем, кто был со мной."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3635
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8f3729b3:

    # RANIA @ talk "For your companions, we have some rooms further down the hall."
    RANIA @ talk "Для ваших спутников у нас есть несколько комнат дальше по коридору."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3636
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_367b6b8c:

    # RANIA @ smile "We hope you enjoy your stay with us."
    RANIA @ smile "Надеемся, вам понравится у нас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3646
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8baba82b:

    # MC @ talk "... Now what?"
    MC @ talk "... Что теперь?"

