translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_95d5d7eb:

    # KIARA @ talk "Rest. Stay here the night where it's safe, in the morning then, my mistress should join us."
    KIARA @ talk "Отдых. Останься здесь на ночь где безопасно, а утром к нам должна присоединиться моя госпожа."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3648
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_9483b162:

    # MC @ think "You still haven't explained everything like you said you would."
    MC @ think "Ты всё ещё не объяснила все, как обещала."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3649
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_384a3513:

    # KIARA @ talk "In time, for now, just rest."
    KIARA @ talk "Со временем, а пока, просто отдохни."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3650
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_5303acdd:

    # KIARA @ talk "It's been quite the journey just to get here."
    KIARA @ talk "Это было настоящее путешествие, чтобы просто добраться сюда."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3651
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_4e981b88:

    # MC @ serious "... Fine."
    MC @ serious "... Ладно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3652
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_5e60fe78:

    # KIARA @ talk "Just call if you need me."
    KIARA @ talk "Просто позови, если я понадоблюсь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3659
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6b3d694c:

    # MC "(...Just what am I walking into now?)"
    MC "(...Во что же я ввязываюсь сейчас?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3660
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_78e5b98a:

    # MC "(I should get some rest.)"
    MC "(Мне стоит отдохнуть.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3690
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_b2f9b151:

    # "... Swirling around me, an endless black sea cut through by a rift of stars and strange colors."
    "... Вокруг меня кружится бесконечное чёрное море, рассечённое разломом из звёзд и странных цветов."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3691
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_f69770e0:

    # "Three bright suns surrounded a great dark circle, radiating a strange power."
    "Три ярких солнца окружали огромный тёмный круг, излучая странную силу."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3692
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_df7c51ac:

    # "Stood on some strange rock platform, the two figures, unlike anything I'd ever seen before, turned their gaze towards me."
    "Стоя на какой-то странной каменной платформе, две фигуры, непохожие ни на что виденное мной прежде, обратили свой взор ко мне."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3693
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_dc2b54fd:

    # MC "Where... Where am I?"
    MC "Где... Где я?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3694
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_ff987929:

    # "I looked down, gazing for where my hands, my body, {i}something{/i} should be."
    "Я посмотрел вниз, пытаясь разглядеть где мои руки, моё тело, {i}что-нибудь{/i} должно быть."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3695
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_a4b95f12:

    # "But there was nothing... It was as though I was just two floating, unblinking eyes, unable to move."
    "Но там ничего не было... Как будто я был всего лишь двумя парящими, немигающими глазами, неспособными двигаться."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3702
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_545bd3fb:

    # "I spoke... And yet my mouth did not move."
    "Я заговорил... И всё же? мой рот не двигался."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3703
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_46bc43b7:

    # HIRRAH "Greetings... [player_name!t]."
    HIRRAH "Приветствую... [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3704
translate ru qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_088be4d0:

